flowchart LR
  PLATFORM["Colaberry platform<br/>records and source code"]
  READ["Read boundary<br/>no write method"]
  PINNED["Pinned rules<br/>commit and file:line"]
  CAPS["Capabilities<br/>one question each"]
  SANDBOX["Sandbox copies<br/>higher rungs rehearsed"]
  OUT["One output shape<br/>verdict, rows cited,<br/>blind spots named"]
  SHADOW["Shadow scorer<br/>judged only on<br/>K.D.'s limits"]
  PEOPLE["People decide<br/>K.D. approves,<br/>A.M. governs"]
  PLATFORM -->|dated export, pulled by an admin| READ
  PLATFORM -->|rules copied at a named commit| PINNED
  READ --> CAPS
  PINNED --> CAPS
  CAPS -->|changes, sandbox only| SANDBOX
  CAPS --> OUT
  OUT --> SHADOW
  OUT --> PEOPLE
  PEOPLE -->|every live change, made by a person| PLATFORM
